---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import sunsetBeach from "@/assets/sunset-beach.png";
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/Base.astro";

const meta = {
	description: "Learn more about the author of this blog.",
	title: "About",
};
---

<PageLayout meta={meta}>
	<div class="space-y-6">
		<h1 class="title">About</h1>
		<div class="flex justify-center">
			<Image
				alt="A beautiful sunset at the beach"
				fetchpriority="high"
				loading="eager"
				src={sunsetBeach}
			/>
		</div>
		<p class="text-md mb-8 leading-relaxed">
			Hey there! I'm thrilled you've stopped by. As a passionate software engineer, I specialize in
			blockchain technology and love crafting efficient command-line interfaces. My journey in tech
			has been an exciting adventure, filled with constant learning and innovation.
		</p>
		<p class="text-md mb-8 leading-relaxed">When I'm not immersed in code, you'll often find me:</p>
		<ul class="text-md mb-8 list-inside list-disc leading-relaxed">
			<li>Sipping on a warm cup of Earl Grey tea</li>
			<li>Tinkering with Arduino-based hobby projects</li>
			<li>Exploring the latest PS5 games (currently obsessed with Assasin's Creeed Valhalla!)</li>
			<li>Taking refreshing swims in the nearby ocean</li>
			<li>Planning my next coastal island getaway</li>
		</ul>
		<p class="text-md mb-8 leading-relaxed">
			There's something truly magical about the combination of sea breeze, sandy shores, and a good
			coding problem to solve. I'm always excited to chat about technology, gaming, or any of my
			adventures. Feel free to reach out – I'd love to hear your stories too!
		</p>

		<p>
			Want to connect or see what I'm working on? Check out my <a
				aria-label="github repository"
				class="cactus-link inline-block"
				href="https://github.com/itsyaasir"
				rel="noreferrer"
				target="_blank">GitHub</a
			> for my latest projects!
		</p>
	</div>
</PageLayout>
